es surgical and nonsurgical aesthetic medical services, diagnostic assessment, injectables, skin/hair treatments, contouring, revision care and selected aesthetic surgery. In-person patient catchment includes Iran and Iraq. Regular hours are Saturday–Thursday 16:00–22:00; Friday closed.","@language":"en"}],"geo":{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#clinic-geo"},"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#clinic-opening-hours-sat-thu"},{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#clinic-friday-closed"}],"hasMap":["https://www.google.com/maps?cid=12350483144643112463","https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%DA%A9%D9%84%DB%8C%D9%86%DB%8C%DA%A9%20%D8%B2%DB%8C%D8%A8%D8%A7%DB%8C%DB%8C%20%D8%AF%DA%A9%D8%AA%D8%B1%20%D9%82%D8%B2%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%B4%20%DA%A9%D8%B1%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86%D8%B4%D8%A7%D9%87&query_place_id=ChIJBTOYDOTt-j8RD-7mAPy6Zas","https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/13530287096","https://balad.ir/p/2dnVakli9ZKaBd","https://yandex.com/maps/org/63459342435/"],"potentialAction":[{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#action-contact-clinic"},{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#action-online-initial-consultation"},{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#action-view-clinic-map"},{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#action-follow-instagram"}],"medicalSpecialty":{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#medical-specialty-aesthetic-medicine"},"logo":{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#image-doctor-ghezelbaash-clinic-logo"},"priceRange":"$$$$"},{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#saeed-ghezelbash","@type":["Person","IndividualPhysician"],"name":[{"@value":"دکتر سعید قزلباش","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"Saeed Ghezelbash","@language":"en"}],"givenName":[{"@value":"سعید","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"Saeed","@language":"en"}],"familyName":[{"@value":"قزلباش","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"Ghezelbash","@language":"en"}],"alternateName":["Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbash","Dr. Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbash","Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbaash","Dr. Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbaash","Saeed Ghezel