elbaash.ir/#image-saeed-ghezelbash-portrait-master","@type":"ImageObject","name":[{"@value":"پرتره رسمی دکتر سعید قزلباش","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"Saeed Ghezelbash, Iranian physician and medical researcher","@language":"en"}],"caption":[{"@value":"دکتر سعید قزلباش (محمدسعید قزلباش)، پزشک ایرانی","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"Saeed Ghezelbash, also known as Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbash, Iranian physician","@language":"en"}],"description":[{"@value":"پرتره رسمی دکتر سعید قزلباش، با نام کامل محمدسعید قزلباش، پزشک و پژوهشگر پزشکی فعال در پزشکی زیبایی در کرمانشاه، ایران، با روپوش سفید و گوشی پزشکی در محیط بالینی کلینیک زیبایی دکتر سعید قزلباش.","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"Canonical portrait of Saeed Ghezelbash, also known as Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbash, an Iranian physician and medical researcher working in aesthetic medicine in Kermanshah, Iran, wearing a white coat and stethoscope at Dr. Saeed Ghezelbash Aesthetic Clinic.","@language":"en"}],"contentUrl":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/media/images/physician/master/saeed-ghezelbaash-physician-portrait.jpg","encodingFormat":"image/jpeg","width":4897,"height":3266,"about":[{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#saeed-ghezelbash"}],"creator":{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#saeed-ghezelbash"},"copyrightHolder":{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#saeed-ghezelbash"},"creditText":"Saeed Ghezelbash / Dr. Saeed Ghezelbash Aesthetic Clinic","copyrightNotice":"© 2023 Saeed Ghezelbash","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saeed-Ghezelbaash-physician-portrait.jpg","sameAs":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saeed-Ghezelbaash-physician-portrait.jpg","dateCreated":"2023-05-29","representativeOfPage":true,"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#webpage"},"alternateName":["Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbash","Dr. Mohammad Saeed Ghezelbash","محمدسعید قزلباش","دکتر محمدسعید قزلباش","Saeed Ghezelbash","Dr. Saeed Ghezelbash","Saeed Ghezelbaash","Dr. Saeed Ghe